#: ../../source/templates_revolut.md:85
msgid "Principles"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_revolut.md:86
msgid ""
"**Weight 500 as display default**: Aeonik Pro uses medium (500) for ALL "
"headings — no bold. This creates authority through size and tracking, not"
" weight."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_revolut.md:87
msgid ""
"**Billboard tracking**: -2.72px at 136px is extremely compressed — text "
"designed to be read at a glance, like airport signage."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_revolut.md:88
msgid ""
"**Positive tracking on body**: Inter uses +0.16px to +0.24px, creating "
"airy, well-spaced reading text that contrasts with the compressed "
"headings."
msgstr ""

